completed_at: "2026-08-17T13:09:01.322Z"
author: "harness:codex"
parent: pm-usfg
resolution: PmClient.listAllComplete and listAllComplete now return only certified whole-workspace results or a typed validation receipt.
expected_result: "SDK consumers can request and prove one complete, unfiltered, unbounded full workspace corpus."
actual_result: Public query/core/runtime/root exports certify every completeness invariant and reject independent negative controls; packed npm and Bun consumers pass.
